# Home sections

## Stack (do not reorder unless asked)

Hero → About → About me → My Art → Artwork marquee → Wanna Do’s → Reviews

Section ids live in `frontend/src/constants/storefrontSections.js`. Header one-page nav scrolls to those hashes (`useStorefrontSectionNav`). Do not use 640px for header layout — header breakpoint is 768px (`site-header.mdc`).

## Shared marquee

Reviews and the artwork strip use the **same** motion and tile size:

- `HomeMarqueeSection.vue` — track, 40s loop, 32px gap, fades, pause on hover
- `MarqueeTile.vue` — 360×280 (320×240 mobile), same radius / shadow / spotlight

Do not fork a second marquee CSS file or a different tile size for reviews vs artwork. Reviews use the quote variant; artwork is image-only in the same tile.

## About me pair

`HomeAboutMeSection.vue`: two tall columns (~88vh / 78vh mobile) with `useScrollParallax` at different Y rates.

Images come from public home page `about_me_left_image_url` / `about_me_right_image_url` (admin customize slots). Empty slots may use `PLACEHOLDER_ARTWORK` until a photo is saved. Parallax only through `useScrollParallax` / `useSectionBackgroundParallax`.
